# Heightmap Generator

An Aseprite extension for generating heightmaps from one or more layers.

## Development setup

Clone the repository with its Aseprite API type definitions:

```sh
git clone --recurse-submodules <repository-url>
```

For an existing clone, initialize the definitions with:

```sh
git submodule update --init --recursive
```

The project-level `.luarc.json` loads the definitions automatically in editors
that use LuaLS. `Aseprite-Library.lua` is a development-only type stub: do not
load it from the extension with `require()` or `dofile()`.

When registering a command, provide the fields required by Aseprite:

```lua
plugin:newCommand {
	id = "HeightmapGenerator",
	title = "Generate Heightmap",
	group = "sprite_properties",
	onclick = function()
		-- Generate the heightmap here.
	end,
}
```
